  message: "WI-nopam (PR #1317) did this item's MOVE half: the third-party taint rows now sit in taint_sources/crypto_community.yaml, key_material_community.yaml and taint_sanitizers/encryption_community.yaml, each declaring provenance: community. They still take full effect (the taint loader globs the directory and does not read the tier). Remaining here: the ADD-ONLY rule (a community sanitizer does not clear a flow; the verdict names the withheld rows), pre-registered and measured A/B."  # bbaf
